OL,3,GNEWSACannabis farmers use former BHS
OL,4,Astore for #1.3m crop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of cannabis farmers who grew
OL,7,Fdrugs with an estimated value of up to
OL,8,F#1.3m in a town's former BHS store have
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FAjet Begu, 40, and Aryan Turya, 27,
OL,12,Fwere growing about 1,700 plants over
OL,13,Ftwo floors of the unit in High Street,
OL,14,FSlough, before police raided and
OL,15,Fdismantled the factory in January.
OL,17,FThe pair, who are both from the
OL,18,FBerkshire town, were jailed for a year
OL,19,Fand two months at Reading Crown Court
OL,20,Fin August after they admitted producing
OL,21,Fthe class B drug.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
